# ACCOUNT_DELETION_CONFIRMATION (en). Biçim: docs-mail/sablon-rehberi.md. Düz metin sürümü bloklardan otomatik üretilir.
subject: LTZ account deletion confirmation
kind: danger
label: ACCOUNT DELETION
title: Confirm your account deletion
note-kind: danger
text: To permanently delete your LTZ account open the link and confirm by typing your username. The link is valid for {{validityMinutes}} minutes, single use, and this cannot be undone.
button: Confirm deletion
link-fallback: If the button does not work, paste this address into your browser:
note: If you did not make this request, ignore this email and change your password.
